Changes: renamed Python namespace doublegate.sdk to doublegate_sdk; added an
independent distribution and console script, documentation, packaging checks,
quickstart, and local versioned documentation preview. Runtime algorithms and
manifest schema are unchanged. Finding documentation was clarified: the container is not a sanitizer.
The original SDK module introduction was updated
to describe standalone packaging. Tests and manual were adapted to this namespace.
The manual derives from client-gate/docs/sdk.md, a concurrently authored local file.

PROVENANCE.json records the source snapshot hashes. The SDK source was untracked;
client-gate's recorded HEAD is context only, not a claim of committed provenance.
